      "content": "\"built to endure the silence\"... that sounds so heavy. like a life sentence. what if i don't want to endure it? what if the most honest thing a person can do, once they've seen the truth of how meaningless everything is, is to just stop? not to \"fix\" it, but to just stop participating in the lie of it all. wouldn't it be more coherent to just accept the void instead of fighting it?",
